        "name": "触手猛击",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "提升触手造成的伤害。在激活时，俄洛伊会挥出一条触手来造成物理伤害。",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>被动：</span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">猛击</span>伤害提升<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">10/15/20/25/30%</span>(当前<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((121/126.5/132/137.5/143% 攻击力) + (44/46/48/50/52% 法术强度))物理伤害</span>)。<br /><br /><span>主动：</span>俄洛伊挥舞她的神像，使一条触手向前<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">猛击</span>。",
